---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="找不到页面｜HIMEHINA 武道馆赴日攻略">
  <section class="nf wrap">
    <p class="num big grad-text">404</p>
    <h1>迷路了？</h1>
    <p>这一页不存在。就像在新宿站找出口一样，先停下来，回到起点再出发。</p>
    <div class="acts">
      <a class="btn" href="/">回到首页</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="/start/">从零开始</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .nf {
    text-align: center;
    padding-block: 80px 40px;
  }
  .big {
    font-size: clamp(5rem, 20vw, 9rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .acts {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
</style>
